        <h2>Is There a Grokipedia API?</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Grokipedia does not offer a dedicated public API.</strong> Grokipedia is a consumer-facing AI encyclopedia product that operates through its web interface. However, the underlying technology powering Grokipedia—xAI's Grok language model—is accessible through the official <strong>xAI API</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Developers seeking to build applications with Grok's capabilities should use the xAI API directly, which provides access to the same AI models that power Grokipedia's content generation.
        </p>

        <h2>xAI Grok API Overview</h2>
        <p>
          The xAI API provides programmatic access to Grok AI models, enabling developers to integrate advanced language capabilities into their applications.
        </p>

