              <li><strong>Text Generation:</strong> Content creation and writing</li>
              <li><strong>Vision:</strong> Image understanding and analysis</li>
              <li><strong>Code Generation:</strong> Programming assistance</li>
              <li><strong>Function Calling:</strong> Tool use and integrations</li>
